Walk through intervals; add before/overlap/after segments to a result list.

```python
def insert(intervals, new):
    out = []
    for i in intervals:
        if i[1] < new[0]:
            out.append(i)
        elif i[0] > new[1]:
            out.append(new)
            new = i
        else:
            new[0] = min(new[0], i[0])
            new[1] = max(new[1], i[1])
    out.append(new)
    return out
